# site/raw/, site/xtal/ and site/pockets_all/ used to be ignored here as
# "regenerable". They are now TRACKED, because the only thing that could
# regenerate them is /home/adsiordia/AF3/BSH_AF3, which is not under version
# control on any machine -- so "regenerable" meant "exists once". Tracking them
# makes the repo a complete copy of what the published Space serves.
#
#   site/raw/           675 whole tetramers, .pdb.gz, ~130 MB (already
#                       compressed, so git cannot shrink it further)
#   site/pockets_all/   3,375 per-rank 8 A crops, .pdb, 138 MB -> ~36 MB packed
#   site/xtal/          3 crystal tetramers, .pdb.gz, 0.8 MB
#                       (rebuild with scripts/make_xtal_pdb.py)
